Jamaican Prime Minister Andrew Holness (@andrewholnessjm) posted a segment of his interview with CNN's Anderson Cooper, expressing empathy with his constituents: "Your residences might have suffered damage or been demolished. I empathize with your sorrow and share in your grief."

